<title>USA: Planar Systems sets share buyback.</title>
<headline>Planar Systems sets share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>BEAVERTON, Ore. 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Planar Systems Inc said it plans to repurchase up to 400,000 shares of its currently outstanding common stock.</p>
</text>
